The page's mechanics (rs_open, rs_page_key, rs_page_enc, rs_enc_th and the
page's destructors: the stock machine-select page with a private copy of its
vtables, presented as the stock opener presents a page, as the CPU page of
tools/machines/cpu/ builds its own), the key event's code accessor taken by
rs_code, and the save's way through the OS (rs_ask_name, rs_run, rs_named: the
UI task's messages, the stock name editor, the FileWriter in flushed pieces)
follow Model-TG (https://github.com/TinyGregAudio/Model-TG): its System page
(mm_open, mm_key, mm_enc), its key_hook and its save of a resampled take
(sv_post, sv_run, rs_name_open, rs_save_do, rs_fw_put): Copyright (c) 2026
TinyGregAudio, MIT License, its text in
tweaks/model-cycles_OS1.13/LICENSE-Model-TG.
